@startuml SafeHome_ClassDiagram

' ===== 类定义开始 =====

class HomeOwner {
  +String name
  +String contactInfo
  +void receiveAlert(String message)
  +void armSystem()
  +void disarmSystem()
}

class Sensor {
  +String sensorId
  +String type       // e.g., Motion, Smoke, Water
  +String location
  +boolean isActive
  +void triggerEvent()
}

class ControlPanel {
  +String panelId
  +boolean isArmed
  +void arm()
  +void disarm()
  +void displayStatus()
}

class System {
  +boolean isSystemArmed
  +List<Sensor> sensors
  +List<Alarm> alarms
  +void processEvent(SensorEvent event)
  +void triggerAlarm(Alarm alarm)
  +void addSensor(Sensor sensor)
}

class SensorEvent {
  +String eventId
  +Sensor sourceSensor
  +DateTime timestamp
  +String eventType
  +void logEvent()
}

class Alarm {
  +String alarmId
  +boolean isTriggered
  +void activate()
  +void deactivate()
}

class FloorPlan {
  +String planId
  +String layoutImageURL
  +List<Sensor> sensorsOnPlan
  +void displaySensors()
  +void updateSensorPosition(Sensor sensor, String newPosition)
}

' ===== 类之间的关系 =====

' HomeOwner 与 System / ControlPanel 有使用关系
HomeOwner --> ControlPanel : 使用

' ControlPanel 与 System 关联，用户通过控制面板操作系统
ControlPanel --> System : 控制

' System 管理多个 Sensor 和 Alarm
System "1" *-- "0..*" Sensor : 包含
System "1" *-- "0..*" Alarm : 触发

' Sensor 可以产生 SensorEvent
Sensor --> SensorEvent : 产生

' System 处理 SensorEvent
System --> SensorEvent : 接收并处理

' Alarm 属于 System，也可以独立存在
System --> Alarm : 管理

' FloorPlan 显示 Sensor 位置信息
FloorPlan "1" *-- "0..*" Sensor : 显示

' 可选：HomeOwner 也可以查看 FloorPlan
HomeOwner --> FloorPlan : 查看

@enduml